{
  "info": {
    "name": "TILLA - market data on one clock",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "# TILLA - market data on one clock\n\nCrypto, US stocks, FX, rates, macro, every BTC/ETH spot ETF fund and our own Bitcoin node on one UTC clock, 1-minute to quarterly, with 293,743 indicators computed with no look-ahead.\n\n## Start in 30 seconds\n1. Get a free key (no card): https://tillacrypto.com - or run **1. Start here > Get a free key**.\n2. Open this collection's **Variables** tab and paste your key into `apiKey`.\n3. Run **Is the API live?**, then anything in **2. Market data**.\n\n`tier` is your plan (free, builder, pro, max). Paid plans add more markets, history and clocks: https://tillacrypto.com/pricing\n\nDocs: https://tillacrypto.com/docs \u00b7 AI agents (MCP): https://tillacrypto.com/mcp \u00b7 Support: support@tillacrypto.com"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "X-API-Key",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{apiKey}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://api.tillacrypto.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "paste-your-free-key-here"
    },
    {
      "key": "tier",
      "value": "free"
    },
    {
      "key": "since",
      "value": "2026-10-30 00:00:00"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Start here (no key needed)",
      "description": "Everything here works without a key.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Is the API live?",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/status",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "status"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The newest 1-minute bar and the plans served.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Plans, prices and limits",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/tiers",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "tiers"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every plan: price, history, requests a minute.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Every market we carry",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/markets",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "markets"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Crypto, US stocks and ETFs, FX and macro - each with its category, related markets and how much each plan holds.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Is every lane current?",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The newest bar of every lane on every layer.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Every call, ready to paste",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/calls",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "calls"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every call with a working URL, what it returns and every error.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Free sample - one tick of the Free plan",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sample/free",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "sample",
                "free"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Real values, no key.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get a free key (no account)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/demo_key",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "demo_key"
              ]
            },
            "description": "One free key per address per day. Paste the key into the collection's apiKey variable. For a key tied to an account, sign up at https://tillacrypto.com.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Market data",
      "description": "Bars are labelled by their close, in UTC. No start = the newest bars. Page forward with next_start while more is true.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Latest BTC and ETH price (1-minute)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/{{tier}}/raw/1min?series=btc_close,eth_close&limit=1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "{{tier}}",
                "raw",
                "1min"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "series",
                  "value": "btc_close,eth_close"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "The newest closed 1-minute bar."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "BTC hourly candles, last 24 hours",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/{{tier}}/raw/hour?series=btc_open,btc_high,btc_low,btc_close,btc_volume&limit=24",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "{{tier}}",
                "raw",
                "hour"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "series",
                  "value": "btc_open,btc_high,btc_low,btc_close,btc_volume"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "24"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Open, high, low, close, volume."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "BTC beside DXY, VIX and Fear & Greed (daily)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/{{tier}}/raw/daily?series=btc_close,dxy_close,vix_close,fear_greed&limit=30",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "{{tier}}",
                "raw",
                "daily"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "series",
                  "value": "btc_close,dxy_close,vix_close,fear_greed"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "30"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Crypto and macro on one clock."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Indicators: RSI, EMA, ATR, correlation (hourly)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/{{tier}}/derived/1hour?series=btc_rsi_14,btc_ema_20,btc_atr_14,btc_corr_30_eth&limit=24",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "{{tier}}",
                "derived",
                "1hour"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "series",
                  "value": "btc_rsi_14,btc_ema_20,btc_atr_14,btc_corr_30_eth"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "24"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Computed bar by bar with no look-ahead."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "One whole market on one clock",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/{{tier}}/market/btc?lane=1min",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "{{tier}}",
                "market",
                "btc"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "lane",
                  "value": "1min"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every series of one market your plan holds. related=1 adds its ETFs and miners."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "History back to 2017 (hourly)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/{{tier}}/deep/hour?series=btc_close&start=2018-01-01&limit=5",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "{{tier}}",
                "deep",
                "hour"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "series",
                  "value": "btc_close"
                },
                {
                  "key": "start",
                  "value": "2018-01-01"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "5"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "The deep history: hourly prices from each market's first bar (crypto 2017, FX 2002)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Same data as CSV",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/{{tier}}/raw/daily?series=btc_close,eth_close&limit=30&format=csv",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "{{tier}}",
                "raw",
                "daily"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "series",
                  "value": "btc_close,eth_close"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "30"
                },
                {
                  "key": "format",
                  "value": "csv"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Add format=csv (or ndjson, parquet) to any data call."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Live and keep in sync",
      "description": "How a bot or a local copy stays current.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Everything that just closed (tick)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/{{tier}}/tick",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "{{tier}}",
                "tick"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every series your key holds, on every lane that closed at this minute, in one answer."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refill after downtime (resume)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/{{tier}}/resume/raw/1min?since={{since}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "{{tier}}",
                "resume",
                "raw",
                "1min"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "since",
                  "value": "{{since}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every bar since you stopped, in one request."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Corrections since a time (changes)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/{{tier}}/changes?since={{since}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "{{tier}}",
                "changes"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "since",
                  "value": "{{since}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every value a source corrected later, with its value now - apply them and your copy stays right."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Live stream (server-sent events)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/{{tier}}/stream?layer=raw&lanes=1min&series=btc_close",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "{{tier}}",
                "stream"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "layer",
                  "value": "raw"
                },
                {
                  "key": "lanes",
                  "value": "1min"
                },
                {
                  "key": "series",
                  "value": "btc_close"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Finished bars as they land."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Your key",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "What my key holds",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/inventory?layer=raw&lane=1min",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "inventory"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "layer",
                  "value": "raw"
                },
                {
                  "key": "lane",
                  "value": "1min"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every series name per layer and lane. Use these names - never guess one."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "My plan and budget right now",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/usage",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "usage"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Plan, history, limits, used today."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Every call for my plan",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/{{tier}}/calls",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "{{tier}}",
                "calls"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every call your plan can make, with ready URLs."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}